message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Context Layer"
type: software
version: "0.4.0"
license: MIT
authors:
  - alias: "solisolsoli"
abstract: >-
  Verbatim, hash-pinned evidence from a Markdown or Obsidian vault for AI
  agents: full-text search plus explicit-link (synaptic) retrieval, an MCP
  server and Claude Code hook, an Obsidian Brain View of each retrieval,
  append-only memory, bounded sub-agent tasks and a sealed benchmark. Python
  standard library only.
keywords:
  - obsidian
  - markdown
  - retrieval
  - context
  - mcp
  - knowledge-base
